	1/Adult life albo
	~	1/Month
	~		|

Adult Mortality rate albo YF=
	1/Adult life albo
	~	1/Month
	~		|

Aedes infections Ae=
	FoI D Mosq ae*Susceptible Ae
	~	Aedes/Month
	~		|

Aedes infections Albo=
	FoI D Mosq albo*Susceptible Albo
	~	Aedes/Month
	~		|

Transmission potential ae=
	Adult Ae*Biting rate ae*Human feeding fraction ae*Vector competence ae
	~	1/Month
	~		|

EIP Chi Ae=
	(5/Temperature Suitability Ae)/30
	~	Month
	~		|

EIP Chi Albo=
	(6/Temp Suitability Albo)/30
	~	Month
	~		|

Birth rate=
	0.00456
	~	1/Month
	~		|

Biting rate ae=
	0.5/30
	~	1/Aedes/Month
	~		|

Biting rate albo=
	0.4/30
	~	1/(Aedes*Month)
	~		|

