	~	1/Month
	~		|

Chi Reproduction Number Ae=
	(Biting rate ae^2)*Human feeding fraction ae*Transmission prob Chik H to M ae*Transmission prob Chi M to H ae\
		*(Total Adult Ae
	/Human population 1)*EXP( -(Adult Mortality rate ae Chi*EIP Chi Ae))/(Adult Mortality rate ae Chi\
		*Chi Recovery rate H)
	~	
	~		|

Chi Reproduction Number Albo=
	(Biting rate albo^2)*Human feeding fraction albo*Transmission prob Chik H to M albo*\
		Transmission prob Chi M to H albo*(Total Adult Albo
	/Human population 1)*EXP( -(Adult Mortality rate albo Chi*EIP Chi Albo))/(Adult Mortality rate albo Chi\
		*Chi Recovery rate H
	)
	~	1/Aedes
	~		|

