	Container Density*Habitat Suitability Ae*Base carrying capacity
	~	Aedes
	~		|

Carrying capacity ALbo=
	Base carrying capacity*Container Density*Habitat Suitability Albo
	~	Aedes
	~		|

Competition pressure ae=
	(Larva Ae+(Alpha Ae*Larva Albo))/Carrying capacity Ae
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

Competition pressure albo=
	(Larva Albo+(Alpha Albo*Larva Ae))/Carrying capacity ALbo
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

